        "metadata": {
          "status": "success",
          "pending": false,
          "prompt": "Overall: premium 10-second product launch film, product hero, clean cinematic grade, real motion throughout (never static).Shot 1 (0-2.5s): fast dolly push-in from wide to medium, a bright light-streak sweeps left-to-right across the surface, faint motion blur on entry, shallow depth of field.Shot 2 (2.5-5.5s): smooth 20-degree orbit around the product, floating dust motes drifting through the light, subtle handheld float, rack focus pulling from foreground bokeh onto the logo area.Shot 3 (5.5-8s): SIGNATURE — a quick digital zoom 'pump' (punch-in then settle) timed to a soft light-bloom flash sweeping past; the product snaps perfectly centered, reflection glints.Shot 4 (8-10s): slow pull-back and gentle upward tilt into negative space, motion eases to a calm hold, aspirational.Energy: Act1 punchy → Act2 controlled → Act3 resolved. Product stays razor-crisp. No text, no watermark.",
